SUMMARY:20s & 30s NET Trail Work Day
LOCATION:139 MA-18\nWestfield\, MA 01085
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, July 11\, 2026 | 9:00 AM\nhttps://activities.outdoo
 rs.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX000001BqfR2AS/\nThe dirt calls to us! And so we 
 must heed it's call! Time for TRAIL WORK!Looking to get out and contribute
  your time to some wonderful trails? Then look no further! We're putting t
 ogether a work party along Section 3 of the New England Trail (near Spring
 field). We'll be building an approach trail for a new campsite that will b
 e installed there. If you have any prior experience with trail work experi
 ence that's excellent. If not\, no worries! You'll be trained and supervis
 ed on the ground by AMC Trails Department staff\, and you'll walk away wit
 h more wonderful\, trail maintenance knowledge than you arrived with.All P
 PE (Personal Protective Equipment) and tools will be provided on site. If 
 you have your own PPE you are welcome to use it if it is rated appropriate
 ly. Participants are responsible for bringing their own work clothes (pant
 s and boots required\, long sleeves recommended). Participants must also p
 rovide their own water and trail lunch.NOTE: Trail Work is physically dema
 nding. Participants must be capable of (but not limited to) a 1 mile hike 
 with fully loaded pack\, work on your feet for multiple hours\, the abilit
 y to safely use hand tools\, and the ability to follow instructions. Rest 
 is of course available\, but please be mindful that this is a physically d
 emanding activity. Different tasks and loads are available for different p
 eople\, but expect to be active all day and to get dirty!At the end of the
  day after we've left the trail better than we found it we'll celebrate wi
 th some dinner paid for by the Worcester Chapter!Trail Work is an excellen
 t opportunity to get out\, meet some cool people\, and see your hard work 
 pay off with the betterment and stewardship of our outdoors. We hope to ha
 ve you join us! Any questions at all please let us know!This event is inte
 nded as an affinity work trip for people in their 20s & 30s. If you are no
 t a member of that group\, please do not sign up for this activity.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a5UVX000001BgY12AK
